  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bukawa Maize Processing and Marketing Project.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: maize ..Beneficiaries: 1266 smallholder farmers of whom 454 are female..Project funds will be used to renovate Bukawas existing store, acquire a tractor for opening land for growing maize, procure value addition and quality improvement equipment, increase working capital for to enable the cooperative bulk more maize as well as procure quality inputs.</narrative>
  </description>
